  "prefLabel": "Home 103.01 Duties and Responsibilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Home 103.01 Duties and Responsibilities. The board shall administer the provisions of RSA 310-A:182-201 which include but are not limited to safeguarding property, to promoting public welfare and maintaining a high standard of integrity, skills and practice in the profession of home inspectors in this state.\n\nSource. #9503, eff 7-8-09",
